<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6601" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄναιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα</span>), opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔναιμος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bloodless,</i> of parts of the
			body, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				70c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prt.</u>
				321b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				495a4
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				520b33
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of
			animals, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				678a33
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
			of colour, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νᾶπυ ἀναιμότερον κεχρωσμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aët.
					1.298
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλωρὰ καὶ ἄ. τὰ πράγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gorg.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>shedding no blood,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοὺς δὲ βροντῆς πνεῦμ᾽ ἄ. ὤλεσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					982
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. νίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					68.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
